{"id":"n61316-1-7","stage":3,"title":"사촌 · 堂表亲","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61316-1-7-1","ko":"주말에 뭐했어?","zh":"周末做什么了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐했어?","meaning":"什么；做，干","explanation":"뭐：什么；하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/41e9c98af73300dd09c9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61316-1-7-2","ko":"유학 갔던 사촌 형도 오랜만에 볼 겸해서 이모 댁에 갔다 왔어.","zh":"我去了姨妈家，也顺便见见出国留学后很久没见的表哥。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유학","meaning":"留学","explanation":"유학：留学","readings":[{"term":"유학","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70244","senseId":"1","lemma":"유학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔던","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사촌","meaning":"堂表亲，堂表兄弟姐妹","explanation":"사촌：堂表亲，堂表兄弟姐妹","readings":[{"term":"사촌","audio":"/audio/cd2309748606381c21a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61316","senseId":"1","lemma":"사촌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"형도","meaning":"哥，哥哥","explanation":"형：哥，哥哥；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20286","senseId":"1","lemma":"형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볼","meaning":"见，碰头","explanation":"보다：见，碰头；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"5","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"겸해서","meaning":"顺便；做，干","explanation":"겸：顺便；하다：做，干；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"겸","audio":"/audio/51efba17db275233b633.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30408","senseId":"2","lemma":"겸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이모","meaning":"阿姨，姨妈","explanation":"이모：阿姨，姨妈","readings":[{"term":"이모","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71153","senseId":"1","lemma":"이모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"댁에","meaning":"府，贵府","explanation":"댁：府，贵府；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"댁","audio":"/audio/1ad485c2f73968fd25de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64392","senseId":"1","lemma":"댁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔다","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：连接途中转换或接续